{"sections":[{"slug":"陈联络","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"陈联络"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">陈联络</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“陈联络”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">陈联络在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上尤其重要</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $(E,h)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hermite向量丛","text":"Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">陈联络</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指满足</span> $\\nabla h =0$, $(\\nabla^{0,1})^2=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯向量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(E,\\bar\\partial_E)$, <span lang=\"zh\">给定其上的</span> Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> $h$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在唯一的陈联络</span> $\\nabla$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\nabla^{0,1}=\\bar\\partial_E$.</p>\n<p>$\\nabla h=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">等价于对</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">光滑截面</span></strong> $s,t$,\n$$\r\nd(h(\\bar s,t)) = h(\\overline{\\nabla s},t)+ h(\\bar s,\\nabla t),\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于全纯向量丛</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> $h$, <span lang=\"zh\">陈联络的联络形式为</span>\n$$\r\n\\omega = h^{-1} \\partial h = (h^{i \\bar k}\\partial h_{\\bar k j}).\r\n$$\n<strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">回忆联络形式</span> $\\omega^i_j$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定义为</span>\n$$\r\n\\nabla e_j = e_i \\otimes \\omega^i_j,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\omega^i_j$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(1,0)$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\n\\underbrace{\\partial h_{\\bar i j}}+ \\bar\\partial h_{\\bar i j} = dh_{\\bar i j}=h_{\\bar k j}\\overline{\\omega^k_i}+ \\underbrace{h_{\\bar i k}\\omega^k_j}.\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\omega^i_{j}=h^{i \\bar k}\\partial h_{\\bar k j},\\quad \\omega = h^{-1}\\partial h.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">曲率</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">带有</span> Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">结构的全纯向量丛上的陈联络的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲率","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span> $(1,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span>\n$$\r\n\\Omega = \\bar\\partial (h^{-1}\\partial h)= \\bar\\partial\\omega.\r\n$$\n<strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\t\\Omega &amp;= d\\omega + \\omega\\wedge\\omega\\\\\r\n\t&amp;= (\\partial+\\bar\\partial)(h^{-1}\\partial h) +h^{-1}\\partial h \\wedge h^{-1}\\partial h\\\\\r\n\t&amp;=\\cdots = \\bar\\partial (h^{-1}\\partial h).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $L\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则有</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">不依赖于平凡化</span>!)\n$$\r\n\\Omega = - \\partial \\bar\\partial \\log h.\r\n$$\n<strong><span lang=\"zh\">推论</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nc_1 = \\frac{i}{2\\pi}\\Omega = - \\frac{i}{2\\pi} \\partial \\bar\\partial  \\log h.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}